Retain signed/HDR encoded ProPhoto RGB until Android's final grade boundary.

Internal view Request/Result extension only; the public spk_result ABI stays
unchanged. The explicit float request requires no-film, disabled adjustments,
identity working space, RGB floats and no proof/export/device-output path.
Reuse view geometry, then read its float plane without the grade's UNORM16
round-trip. Android owns the vector separately for preview, cached repack and
TIFF rows. Normal desktop/film/DI requests keep their existing path.
Clear the opt-in 0029 scene curve from the independent medium probe.
Co-created with GPT (OpenAI), 2026-11-09.

